 in the international system for staging lung cancer</article-title><source>Chest</source><year>1997</year><volume>111</volume><fpage>1710</fpage><lpage>1717</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Chest||111|1710||bib22|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9187198</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Myrdal</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Lambe</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hillerdal</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Lamberg</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Agustsson</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Stahle</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of delays on prognosis in patients with non-small cell lung cancer</article-title><source>Thorax</source><year>2004</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>49</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Thorax||59|45||bib23|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14694247</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>National Audit Office</collab></person-group><article-title/><source>Tackling Cancer in England: Saving More Lives</source><year>2004</year><publisher-name>London: The Stationery Office</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nosarti</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Crayford</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Roberts</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name><name><surname>Elias</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>McKenzie</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>David</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Delay in presentation of symptomatic referrals to a breast clin